# Guard: a worker with a bow from the Armory (StructureSystem::tickCarriers moves it and shoots for it: no physics
# body, no unit sim, and nothing can hurt it). Global: the game writes its position. Spawned with its feet on the road.
# SHAPE (a placeholder; uniform scales): a dark red tunic (the root), a head, a helmet, and the BOW it holds in FRONT
# of its body (-Z: an entity's forward is -Z).
# CullMode RootOnly: the root culls for all its pieces.
Prefab gameGuard
	Global true
	CullMode RootOnly
	Component Render
		ObjectContainer baseshapes
		Node Pillar2
		Type StaticMesh
		Color 0.55 0.14 0.12
		Position 0 0.5 0
		Scale 0.22
	Component Scene
		Entity
			Name Head
			Position 0 1.1 0
			Component Render
				ObjectContainer baseshapes
				Node Sphere
				Type StaticMesh
				Color 0.85 0.68 0.5
				Scale 0.17
		Entity
			Name Helmet
			Position 0 1.24 0
			Component Render
				ObjectContainer baseshapes
				Node CubeQuarter
				Type StaticMesh
				Color 0.55 0.55 0.6
				Scale 0.2
		Entity
			Name Bow
			Position 0.12 0.75 -0.32
			Component Render
				ObjectContainer baseshapes
				Node Pillar3
				Type StaticMesh
				Color 0.36 0.24 0.12
				Scale 0.07
